 {
  "id": "application",
  "name": "Application",
  "kind": "class",
  "declaration": "public final class Application",
  "abstract": "高层应用宿主。隐藏窗口、设备、DrawList 绘制器、 `TextEnvironment`、`ViewGraph` 等装配细节。",
  "discussion": [
   "调用方使用方式：",
   "```swift\ntry Application.run(config: ApplicationConfiguration(title: \"My App\")) {\n    RootView()\n}\n```",
   "主窗口与辅助窗口共享 UI 资源，各自拥有 presentation target。\n`backend: device` 可与生产 NativeRenderer 共享设备与 viewport。"
  ],
  "availability": [],
  "conforms": [],
  "members": [
   {
    "name": "run",
    "kind": "func",
    "declaration": "public static func run<Root: View>(config: ApplicationConfiguration = ApplicationConfiguration(), backend: Device? = nil, events: PlatformEventBridge = PlatformEventBridge(), checkpoint: ApplicationCheckpoint? = nil, onTick: ((_ deltaTime: Double) -> Void)? = nil, onDisplayReady: ((AppDisplayHandle) -> Void)? = nil, onDiagnosticsReady: ((UIDiagnostics?) -> Void)? = nil, @ViewBuilder rootView: @escaping () -> Root) throws",
    "abstract": "启动主窗口并阻塞直到窗口关闭。返回值仅用于错误传递。",
    "discussion": [
     "`onTick` 会在每一帧 layout 之前调用，用于把外部子系统（例如游戏引擎\n`EngineHost`）按 UI 帧率推进。`deltaTime` 是上一帧到这一帧之间的秒数。"
    ]
   }
  ],
